tructures.  Active lines remain\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/16de56c4/D15/0/code.py:133:    into multiple color-coded intervals.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/16de56c4/D15/0/code.py:196:                f\"{color} appears multiple times: {positions}\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8b7bacbf/11/code.py:302:      closed background cavities whose boundaries use multiple colors.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/28a6681f/D1/0/code.py:25:#       its interior endpoint is the nozzle tip; the ray direction is the guide direction continued forward\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/28a6681f/D1/0/code.py:27:#       a contiguous run of blue pixels starts immediately after the guide tip on the same line\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/28a6681f/D1/0/code.py:58:#       all blue pixels form one contiguous source run immediately after the tip\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/28a6681f/D1/0/code.py:175:def _source_after_tip(grid: np.ndarray, tip: tuple[int, int], step: tuple[int, int], water: int) -> list[tuple[int, int]]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/28a6681f/D1/0/code.py:178:    r = int(tip[0] + step[0])\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/28a6681f/D1/0/code.py:179:    c = int(tip[1] + step[1])\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/28a6681f/D1/0/code.py:195:    - A contiguous source run of water begins immediately after the guide tip on the same lattice line.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/28a6681f/D1/0/code.py:198:    - Read the guide orientation from its border endpoint toward its interior tip.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/28a6681f/D1/0/code.py:211:    _guide_color, guide_pts, tip, step = _guide_info(g, bg, water)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/28a6681f/D1/0/code.py:212:    source = _source_after_tip(g, tip, step, water)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/28a6681f/D1/0/code.py:213:    assert source, \"expected water source immediately after guide tip\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/28a6681f/D1/0/code.py:219:        line_after_tip = _