came teal. In this variant they are still detected\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/1818057f/D6/2/code.py:34:#    - The original scan could have recolored overlapping '+' footprints multiple times.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/1818057f/D6/2/code.py:38:#    Each target component is a '+' cross plus a compact one-cell-wide tail. The tail is\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/898e7135/D14/0/code.py:126:    assert w >= 2, \"grid too narrow for legend\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b10624e5/D5/3/code.py:50:    - generator enforces asymmetric source motifs and target sizes that preserve enough detail.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/19/code.py:390:    - There are multiple local-background hollow-square candidates.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f560132c/8/code.py:43:#    - The nearest piece to the strip is always the L-shaped anchor; the other three are pushed outside\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88bcf3b4/D15/0/code.py:33:#     - bar 使用局部坐标区间 [-attach_depth, tail_len]，其中 attach_depth 取 bar 中央位置，tail_len >= 2。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88bcf3b4/D15/0/code.py:44:#     - 额外统计 attach 后 bar 尾长 tail_len 以及“原 solver 在这些输入上失败或给出不同输出”的比例，防止样本退化回原题。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88bcf3b4/D15/0/code.py:575:    stays visually detached from the bar tail.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88bcf3b4/D15/0/code.py:644:    tail_len = bar_len - 1 - attach_depth\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88bcf3b4/D15/0/code.py:651:    bar = [(k, 0) for k in range(-attach_depth, tail_len + 1)]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88bcf3b4/D15/0/code.py:703:        \"tail_len\": tail_len,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88bcf3b4/D15/0/code.py:742:            \"terminal\": _transform([(triple[\"tail_len\"], 0)], edge, n, pos, attach_depth)[0],\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88bcf3b4/D15/0/code.py:744:            \"tail_len\": triple[\"tail_len\"],\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/446ef5d2/D12/2/code.py:69:#     line that is \"quietly