igned copy of pattern A.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/67e490f4/D9/0/code.py:37:#    each shape has repeated evidence via multiple sprite copies.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/67e490f4/D9/0/code.py:82:#      Generator: every chosen shape scatters multiple winning sprites.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/97d7923e/17/code.py:27:#    - D12 alone changes the choice process: if the same cap color appears multiple\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/97d7923e/17/code.py:346:    double as legend columns; repeated legend entries allocate multiple early columns to one group.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/d35bdbdc/14/code.py:138:      - border color appears multiple times\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/64efde09/D4/2/code.py:160:    assert len(sprites_raw) >= 2, \"expected multiple transformed rectangular sprites\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/800d221b/2/code.py:29:#    - Samples deliberately contain both minority colors and unequal path multiplicities, so a human can see that hub\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/f560132c/D3/0/code.py:33:#    that multiple training examples can show clearly different non-rectangular outlines.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D11/3/code.py:38:# - Each grid still has multiple rays (at least 4 markers because each diamond has\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D11/3/code.py:42:#   multiple objects block or overlap hypothetical rays.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3a25b0d8/13/code.py:41:#      edge legend, then recolor before filling\", rather than changing multiple\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3a25b0d8/13/code.py:82:#    - Since the mapping is a bijection / derangement, multiple holes often reuse\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/31f7f899/D3/3/code.py:15:#    same odd width and the same vertical axis, but is split into multiple monochrome rectangles\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/31f7f899/D3/3/code.py:62:# - each non-baseline color appears in exactly one slot, possibly split into multiple components;\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/d35bdbdc/12/code.py:193:      - one border color appearing multiple times\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D20/0/code.py:49:#     - `generate_input()` 通过固定 divider 调色板、设置 hidden tail > 0、并用\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D20/0/code.py:76:    Input is multiple frames concatenated horizontally, separated by full-height\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D20/0/code.py:197:        f\"head={head} dir={d}: markers reachable in multiple directions \"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D20/0/code.py:274:    latest visible frame to simulate, while the triangle tip still determines the path.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D20/0/code.py:379:    hidden_tail = int(rng.integers(*HIDDEN_TAIL_RANGE))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D20/0/code.py:381:    n_steps = output_step + hidden_tail\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D20/0/code.py:402:    return n_steps, h, w, bg, actor, hidden_tail, tname, frame_steps, divider_colors, gap2, output_step\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D20/0/code.py:548:        hidden_tail,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D20/0/code.py:597:    if len(f_markers) != last_gap + hidden_tail:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D20/0/code.py:622:            \"hidden_tail\": hidden_tail,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/64efde09/D6/1/code.py:152:    assert len(sprites_raw) >= 2, \"expected multiple transformed rectangular sprites\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/f560132c/D3/1/code.py:77:#   - the new behavior is visible because central cells are covered by multiple layers and the topmost color changes\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/97d7923e/20/code.py:33:#      order is spread across multiple bar blocks instead of being concentrated in one corner.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3a25b0d8/23/code.py:44:#      the two objects, while still allowing dst itself to contain multiple raw components.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/800d221b/D5/1/code.py:8:# - Variant detail: 种子内部包含三种或更多颜色（而非仅两种），多数色判定需要在更多候选中选择。增加颜色计数的复杂度。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/64efde09/D14/1/code.py:186:    assert len(sprites_raw) >= 2, \"expected multiple transformed rectangular sprites\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6ffbe589/18/code.py:26:#   multiple different rotations, including the wrap-around case rank 4 -> 0, without creating\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D1/0/code.py:8:#    The triangle sprite remains a monochrome arrow and the input still contains\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D1/0/code.py:14:#    still axis-aligned so the arrow orientation can keep tracking travel\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D1/0/code.py:28:#      That fails once markers have multiple colors, so agent detection now\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D1/0/code.py:69:    Input is multiple frames concatenated horizontally, separated by full-height\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D1/0/code.py:269:    Key insight: The arrow shape still gives the sprite's current head and facing, but target selection no longer depends on directional alignment; it depends on matching the sprite color to the left half of the remaining colored domino chain.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D1/0/code.py:303:    multiples = [n for n in range(*STEPS_RANGE) if n % n_frames == 0]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D1/0/code.py:304:    weights = np.array([(n ** 2) / (_STEP_AVAILABILITY[n] ** 2) for n in multiples], dtype=float)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D1/0/code.py:306:    n_steps = int(rng.choice(multiples, p=weights))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/97d7923e/2/code.py:45:#      across multiple fill groups and by mixing at least two cap colors inside each group.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/97d7923e/2/code.py:84:#    - Each legend color already appears as the interior color of multiple bars, so the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/f560132c/D4/1/code.py:437:    \"\"\"Build an L-shaped legend piece mask anchored at (0,0) of the side*side grid.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3a25b0d8/22/code.py:90:multiple cavities, so a small number of examples is enough to support the legend.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/800d221b/D5/3/code.py:8:# - Variant detail: 种子区域没有P色边框包围，直接与背景相邻。路径直接连接到种子内部像素。解题者需要通过颜色差异而非边框来识别种子。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/64efde09/D14/2/code.py:181:    - Several dense 2-by-N or N-by-2 rectangular sprites are dihedral transforms of one narrow template.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/64efde09/D14/2/code.py:222:    assert len(sprites) >= 2, \"expected multiple transformed rectangular sprites\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6ffbe589/25/code.py:290:      90-degree multiple used to rotate that band inside its own square.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/67e490f4/D2/1/code.py:394:def _multiplicity_weights(th, tw):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/67e490f4/D2/1/code.py:438:    mult_vals, mult_wts = _multiplicity_weights(th, tw)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D11/1/code.py:49:  with matched opposite sides, then places multiple markers along each side when\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D11/1/code.py:89:  following the remaining spiral tail, not an arbitrary turn sequence.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D11/1/code.py:140:    Input is multiple frames concatenated horizontally, separated by full-height\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D11/1/code.py:285:        f\"head={head} dir={d}: markers reachable in multiple directions \"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D11/1/code.py:443:    Key insight: the triangle tip gives the current facing, and the marker trail is\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D11/1/code.py:444:    not an arbitrary bendy path but the unfinished tail of a one-handed rectangular spiral.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D11/1/code.py:491:    multiples = [n for n in range(*STEPS_RANGE) if n % n_frames == 0]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D11/1/code.py:492:    weights = np.array([(n ** 3) / (_STEP_AVAILABILITY[n] ** 2) for n in multiples], dtype=float)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D11/1/code.py:494:    n_steps = int(rng.choice(multiples, p=weights))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/800d221b/D5/2/code.py:8:# - Variant detail: 种子区域不限于矩形，可以是L形、T形等不规则连通区域。改变了源对象的识别难度，解题者需要处理非矩形边界。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/97d7923e/16/code.py:53:#    group contains multiple fill hues. The generator also forces at least one example\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/97d7923e/16/code.py:197:    - If multiple bars have the same fill length, break that tie by the visible fill-color\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/31f7f899/D4/2/code.py:20:   - To make tight-crop observable, the generator narrows the baseline from “full row”\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/31f7f899/D4/2/code.py:45:     preferring colors that appear in multiple separated runs on one row; the segmented\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/800d221b/19/code.py:48:#     each edge, and no extra legends or decorations. Objects do not overlap or stack multiple annotations.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a6f40cea/D4/0/code.py:91:#       accumulate multiple incompatible crossings.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3a25b0d8/30/code.py:28:  colors, so color only narrows the search to a group; it does not identify the true `dst`\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3a25b0d8/30/code.py:111:  2. at least one receiver-color group has multiple empty frames,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/f560132c/D15/0/code.py:316:    - The legend sprite is still L-shaped, but now its top arm and left arm have different lengths, which acts as a direction cue.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/f560132c/D15/0/code.py:421:    \"\"\"Build an L-shaped 